<!--
  Simplified Chinese copy for every native surface: notifications, the
  foreground-service chip, Quick Settings tiles, launcher shortcuts and the
  home-screen widgets. These strings are not part of the Flutter ARB
  catalogues, so a Chinese person read English here while the app itself was
  Chinese (NativeStrings.supported listed only "en" and "ar").
  Keep this file in step with values/strings.xml: the same names, the same
  format arguments (%1$s, %1$d), and only the "other" plural quantity,
  which is the only one Chinese uses.
-->
